        :rulingDate "2006-07-15"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """When Phyrexian Soulgorger’s cumulative upkeep ability resolves, you must either sacrifice a different creature for each age counter on Phyrexian Soulgorger or sacrifice it. You may also sacrifice it as part of its own upkeep payment."""@en ] .
